                "recommended": "<strong>Recomendados:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Sistema Operativo:</strong> mac OS Mojave version 10.14.2<br></li><li><strong>Processador:</strong> 2.6 Ghz Intel 6-Core i7 processor<br></li><li><strong>Memória:</strong> 16 GB de RAM<br></li><li><strong>Placa gráfica:</strong> AMD Radeon Vega 20<br></li><li><strong>Espaço no disco:</strong> Requer 999 MB de espaço livre<br></li><li><strong>Placa de som:</strong> N/A<br></li><li><strong>Notas adicionais:</strong> Should run smoothly on highest settings: Quality set to 3/3, and Resolution to 9/9</li></ul>"
