                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I love it. The graphics for a Unity game its EXACTLY what i was looking for a star fox clone and the characters and dialogues are well written and well acted. Im on mission 4 and i already want a sequel, its THAT good. The gameplay its the cherry on top: super responsive, speedy and even if derivative manage to stand on his own, thanks to the strafe system the game use for movement. The all-range mode missions are a joy to play. Super raccomanded, cant believe this gem passed me by but im glad i found it! \nHope to see more in the future, with tps ground mission too a la star fox assoult!\n\nEDIT: THIS FLIPPING GAME SAVE MID MISSION AND YOU CAN EXIT AS LONG AS YOU PASSD A CHECKPOINT, THIS GAME IS AMAZING!!",
